#: ../../topics/modules.rst:110
msgid ""
"The name of a module is the same wherever it is used: in the build tag, "
"in the ``modules`` line of ``anet version``, in the ``without`` setting, "
"in the installation option and under ``modules`` in ``config.json``. Two "
"modules have older top-level configuration keys, ``auto_reply`` and "
"``stream_preview``. These keys are fixed, and the form "
"``modules.autoreply`` or ``modules.preview`` is rejected."
msgstr ""
"模块名称在所有使用处都相同：构建标签、\\ ``anet version`` 的 ``modules`` 一行、\\ ``without`` "
"设置、安装选项，以及 ``config.json`` 中 ``modules`` 之下。有两个模块使用较早的顶层配置键，即 "
"``auto_reply`` 和 ``stream_preview``\\ 。这些键是固定的，``modules.autoreply`` 或 "
"``modules.preview`` 的写法会被拒绝。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:117
msgid ""
"A build tag that starts with ``no_`` removes a module from the binary. "
"The tag ``shell`` is additive: the module is included only when the tag "
"is given."
msgstr "以 ``no_`` 开头的构建标签会从二进制文件中移除一个模块。标签 ``shell`` 是附加式的：只有给出该标签时才包含该模块。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:120
msgid ""
"The console has no build tag in 0.3.0. A build with ``scripts/build.sh "
"--without console`` is refused with ``build_tag_pending``, and the "
"console is turned off with ``without`` in the configuration. A tag for it"
" follows in a 0.3 patch release. The names of the tags that exist are "
"printed by ``scripts/tagcheck.sh list`` in the source tree."
msgstr ""
"控制台在 0.3.0 中没有构建标签。``scripts/build.sh --without console`` 会以 "
"``build_tag_pending`` 被拒绝，控制台通过配置中的 ``without`` 关闭。其标签将在 0.3 "
"的补丁版本中提供。源码树中现有的标签可用 ``scripts/tagcheck.sh list`` 输出。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:128
msgid "What a default node includes"
msgstr "默认节点包含什么"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:130
msgid ""
"The released builds are the *default* build and the *shell* build. The "
"default build includes every module except ``shell``. The shell build, "
"selected at installation with ``--shell``, adds ``shell``. There are no "
"further prebuilt variants: a node that needs a different set of modules "
"turns modules off with ``without`` (see below), or is built from the "
"source with the tags of the section :ref:`topics-modules-build`. The "
"section :ref:`topics-modules-recipes` gives the combinations that the "
"repository tests."
msgstr ""
"发布的构建有\\ *默认*\\ 构建和 *shell* 构建。默认构建包含除 ``shell`` 以外的所有模块。shell 构建在安装时以 "
"``--shell`` 选择，额外包含 ``shell``。没有其他预编译的变体：需要不同模块组合的节点，可以用 ``without`` "
"关闭模块（见下文），或按 :ref:`topics-modules-build` 一节的标签从源码构建。:ref:`topics-modules-"
"recipes` 一节给出仓库测试过的组合。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:145
msgid ""
"The ``modules`` line lists the modules that the binary contains, in "
"alphabetical order, and ``(none)`` for a binary that has only the kernel."
" The ``variant`` line names the released build (``default`` or "
"``shell``); a binary built locally shows ``none``. ``/status`` carries "
"the same information in the member ``build``, with the lists ``modules`` "
"and ``without``."
msgstr ""
"``modules`` 行按字母顺序列出二进制所含的模块；只有内核的二进制显示为 ``(none)``。``variant`` "
"行给出发布构建的名称（``default`` 或 ``shell``）；本地构建的二进制显示 ``none``。``/status`` 在成员 "
"``build`` 中给出相同的信息，包括列表 ``modules`` 和 ``without``。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:151
msgid ""
"After ``anet init`` and ``anet up``, a default node does the following "
"without further configuration:"
msgstr "执行 ``anet init`` 和 ``anet up`` 之后，默认节点无需进一步配置即可做到以下几点："

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:154
msgid "It runs the control interface on a local socket, protected by a token."
msgstr "在本地套接字上运行控制接口，由令牌保护。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:155
msgid "It runs the local A2A interface on a loopback port, protected by a token."
msgstr "在回环端口上运行本地 A2A 接口，由令牌保护。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:156
msgid ""
"It serves the local web console through the control interface. A browser "
"session needs a single-use ticket from ``anet console``."
msgstr "通过控制接口提供本地 Web 控制台。浏览器会话需要来自 ``anet console`` 的一次性票据。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:158
msgid ""
"It can read balances and quotes. Its payment limits are 0 for the "
"automatic and agent tiers, and no payee is listed, so it pays nothing "
"without a person."
msgstr "可以读取余额和报价。其自动层和 Agent 层的付款限额均为 0，且未列出任何收款方，因此没有人工介入时不会支付任何款项。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:160
msgid "It requests previews for a task only when a local client asks for them."
msgstr "仅当本地客户端要求时，才为任务请求预览。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:162
msgid "Every other module does nothing until it is configured."
msgstr "其他每个模块在配置之前都不执行任何操作。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:165
msgid "Turning a module off"
msgstr "关闭模块"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:167
msgid ""
"A module can be turned off in the configuration. A module that is turned "
"off is still in the binary, but it is never started."
msgstr "模块可以在配置中关闭。被关闭的模块仍在二进制文件中，但从不启动。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:170
msgid ""
"The ``without`` setting is a list of module names at the top level of "
"``config.json``:"
msgstr "``without`` 设置是 ``config.json`` 顶层的模块名称列表："

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:179
msgid "The file is changed only while the node is stopped. Two commands do this."
msgstr "仅在节点停止时才修改该文件。有两条命令可以完成这一操作。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:187
msgid ""
"``anet init --without`` adds names and never removes them. It refuses to "
"turn off a module whose configuration block exists in ``config.json``; "
"remove the block first. ``anet init --with p2p`` removes one name from "
"the list. Both commands refuse to run while the daemon is running, and "
"they change nothing in that case."
msgstr ""
"``anet init --without`` 只添加名称，从不删除名称。如果 ``config.json`` "
"中存在某模块的配置块，则拒绝关闭该模块，须先移除该配置块。\\ ``anet init --with p2p`` "
"从列表中移除一个名称。两条命令在守护进程运行时都会拒绝执行，此时不做任何更改。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:192
msgid ""
"Every module of the table can be named, with two limits. The names "
"``autoreply`` and ``preview`` turn off the modules whose settings are the"
" top-level keys ``auto_reply`` and ``stream_preview``; the forms "
"``modules.autoreply`` and ``modules.preview`` are refused. A name that is"
" not the name of a module is refused with ``config_invalid``, and the "
"shell module is turned off by not installing it."
msgstr ""
"表中的每个模块都可以写入，但有两点限制。名称 ``autoreply`` 与 ``preview`` 关闭的是其设置为顶层键 "
"``auto_reply`` 与 ``stream_preview`` 的模块；形式 ``modules.autoreply`` 与 "
"``modules.preview`` 会被拒绝。不是模块名称的名称会以 ``config_invalid`` 被拒绝，而 shell "
"模块通过不安装来关闭。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:199
msgid ""
"There is no way to change ``without`` through the control interface, MCP "
"or the local A2A interface. A peer on the network, and a program that "
"holds only the control token, cannot turn a module back on."
msgstr "无法通过控制接口、MCP 或本地 A2A 接口更改 ``without``\\ 。网络上的对端，以及仅持有控制令牌的程序，都不能重新开启某个模块。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:203
msgid ""
"At installation, the option ``--without`` of the installation script does"
" the same before the first start:"
msgstr "安装时，安装脚本的 ``--without`` 选项在首次启动之前起到同样的作用："

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:210
msgid ""
"If any name is not valid for the selected build, nothing is installed. "
"The script has no ``--with`` option. To turn a module back on, use ``anet"
" init --with``."
msgstr ""
"只要有任何一个名称对所选构建无效，就不会安装任何内容。脚本没有 ``--with`` 选项。要重新开启模块，请使用 ``anet init "
"--with``\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:217
msgid "Building without a module"
msgstr "构建不含某模块的节点"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:219
msgid ""
"A node can be built without the code of a module. This is a stronger "
"statement than turning the module off: the symbols of the module are not "
"in the binary. The repository checks this by counting symbols in both "
"directions."
msgstr "节点可以在构建时不包含某模块的代码。这比关闭模块更强：模块的符号不在二进制文件中。仓库通过双向统计符号数来检查这一点。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:230
msgid ""
"``build.sh`` does the same from the names of the modules, and also builds"
" with the additive module:"
msgstr "``build.sh`` 可按模块名称完成同样的事，也可以用它构建带有加法模块的版本："

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:238
msgid ""
"Combine tags with commas. ``scripts/tagcheck.sh list`` prints the tags of"
" the source tree, and ``scripts/tagcheck.sh all`` checks them in both "
"directions by counting symbols. A build that contains a configuration "
"block for a module it lacks does not start."
msgstr ""
"标签之间以逗号组合。``scripts/tagcheck.sh list`` 输出源码树的标签，``scripts/tagcheck.sh "
"all`` 通过统计符号数在两个方向上检查它们。含有已缺失模块的配置块的构建不会启动。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:243
msgid ""
"The module ``shell`` is the one additive module. The default build does "
"not contain it, because it is the only module that turns a network "
"request into a command on the host, and the operator must choose it on "
"purpose:"
msgstr "``shell`` 模块是唯一的附加式模块。默认构建不含它，因为它是唯一会把网络请求转化为主机上命令的模块，必须由运营人员有意选择："

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:251
msgid ""
"Leaving modules out makes the binary smaller (see :ref:`topics-modules-"
"recipes`), but the reason to do it is the reduction of what the node can "
"be asked to do, not the size."
msgstr "去掉模块会使二进制变小（参见 :ref:`topics-modules-recipes`），但这样做的理由是减少节点可能被要求做的事，而不是体积。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:256
msgid "The effect of absence"
msgstr "缺失的影响"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:258
msgid ""
"A module is *available* when it is in the binary and is not in "
"``without``. A module that is not available behaves as follows."
msgstr "模块在位于二进制文件中且不在 ``without`` 中时为\\ *可用*。不可用的模块表现如下。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:261
msgid "At start"
msgstr "启动时"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:262
msgid ""
"A ``config.json`` that contains the configuration of an unavailable "
"module prevents the start, with the sentence "
"``module_absent.configured``. The message names the key, states the "
"reason and gives the remedy. A node never starts with a module that is "
"configured and not running."
msgstr ""
"``config.json`` 含有不可用模块的配置时，节点不会启动，说明语句为 ``module_absent.configured``\\ "
"。该消息指明相应的键、说明原因并给出补救办法。节点绝不会在存在已配置但未运行的模块的情况下启动。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:267
msgid "On the local interfaces"
msgstr "在本地接口上"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:268
msgid ""
"Each entry point of the module remains in place and answers with the code"
" ``module_absent``. The control interface answers with status 409 and the"
" local A2A interface with ``UnsupportedOperationError``. A command-line "
"command that belongs to the module exits with status 2 without contacting"
" the daemon. The sentence names the reason (the binary does not contain "
"the module, or the node turned it off) and the remedy."
msgstr ""
"模块的每个入口依然保留，并以代码 ``module_absent`` 应答。控制接口以状态 409 应答，本地 A2A 接口以 "
"``UnsupportedOperationError`` 应答。属于该模块的命令行命令以状态 2 "
"退出，不联系守护进程。说明语句指明原因（二进制文件不含该模块，或节点已将其关闭）和补救办法。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:275
msgid "To a peer"
msgstr "对对端"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:276
msgid ""
"The node behaves as if the feature were off. A node without auto-reply "
"leaves tasks in its inbox. A node without preview never declares previews"
" and drops the frames it receives. A node without payment answers a call "
"to a priced capability with ``payments_unavailable`` and does not run the"
" work. A node without ``p2p`` publishes no direct address."
msgstr ""
"节点的表现如同该功能已关闭。没有自动回复的节点把任务留在收件箱。没有预览的节点从不声明预览，并丢弃收到的帧。没有付款的节点对收费能力的调用应答 "
"``payments_unavailable``，且不执行工作。没有 ``p2p`` 的节点不发布直接地址。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:282
msgid "In the kernel"
msgstr "在内核中"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:283
msgid ""
"Rules that protect data stay in force in every build. Working directories"
" of past agent runs are deleted on time, the list of paths that a sandbox"
" never mounts is kept, and the facts about prices are kept."
msgstr "保护数据的规则在每种构建中都保持有效。过往 Agent 运行的工作目录按时删除，沙箱绝不挂载的路径列表得以保留，有关价格的事实也得以保留。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:287
msgid "No fallback"
msgstr "不回退"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:288
msgid ""
"A feature does not fall back to a weaker path. A turn that needs the "
"sandbox is not run directly, and a preview is not sent through another "
"channel."
msgstr "功能不会回退到较弱的路径。需要沙箱的一轮对话不会直接运行，预览也不会经由其他通道发送。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:291
#: ../../topics/modules.rst:357
msgid "Examples of the sentences:"
msgstr "说明语句示例："

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:302
msgid "What each module does when it is absent"
msgstr "模块缺失时的效果"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:309
msgid "Effect of absence"
msgstr "缺失的影响"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:311
msgid ""
"No loopback listener for the local A2A interface and no proxy cards. The "
"commands and the MCP tools are not affected."
msgstr "没有本机 A2A 接口的回环监听，也没有代理卡片。命令和 MCP 工具不受影响。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:314
msgid "Device capabilities of ANetLink are not offered or called."
msgstr "不提供也不调用 ANetLink 的设备能力。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:316
msgid ""
"There is no auto-reply loop and no local program is started for a task. "
"Tasks stay in the inbox. ``POST /autoreply`` and ``POST /autoreply-test``"
" and the command ``anet autoreply`` answer ``module_absent`` (exit status"
" 2). ``/status`` has no member ``auto_reply``. The doctor item "
"``auto_reply`` is informational and there are no ``sandbox`` items. "
"``anet peers trust`` asks with the sentence ``trust_confirm.no_agent``, "
"which states that trust decides only whether local backends take the "
"tasks. The console hides the hint for the auto-reply. An ``auto_reply`` "
"block in ``config.json`` stops the start (``module_absent.configured``)."
msgstr ""
"没有自动回复循环，也不会为任务启动本地程序，任务留在收件箱中。``POST /autoreply`` 与 ``POST /autoreply-"
"test`` 以及命令 ``anet autoreply`` 以 ``module_absent`` 应答（退出状态 2）。``/status``"
" 没有成员 ``auto_reply``。诊断项 ``auto_reply`` 为提示级别，且没有 ``sandbox`` 各项。``anet "
"peers trust`` 使用句子 ``trust_confirm.no_agent`` "
"询问，说明信任只决定本地后端是否接收任务。控制台隐藏自动回复的提示。``config.json`` 中的 ``auto_reply`` "
"块会阻止启动（``module_absent.configured``）。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:325
msgid "``blackboard``, ``cas``, ``org``"
msgstr "``blackboard``, ``cas``, ``org``"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:326
msgid "The capabilities of the module are not offered."
msgstr "不提供该模块的能力。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:328
msgid "``anet console`` and the routes of the console answer ``module_absent``."
msgstr "``anet console`` 与控制台的路由以 ``module_absent`` 应答。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:330
msgid ""
"``anet mcp`` and ``anet agents`` answer ``module_absent`` (exit status "
"2), whether the module is not compiled or turned off."
msgstr ""
"无论模块是未编入还是被关闭，``anet mcp`` 与 ``anet agents`` 都以 ``module_absent`` 应答（退出状态"
" 2）。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:333
msgid "No direct address is published and no direct connection is accepted."
msgstr "不发布直连地址，也不接受直连。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:335
msgid ""
"The node does not declare the extension ``anet-preview/v1`` and does not "
"ask for previews. Preview frames that arrive are dropped and counted as "
"``preview-unsupported``. ``anet preview`` and ``POST /tasks/preview`` "
"answer ``module_absent``, and ``/status`` has no member ``preview``. "
"``anet delegate --watch`` prints one line on standard error and then "
"waits for the final answer. A ``stream_preview`` other than ``off`` stops"
" the start (``module_absent.configured``)."
msgstr ""
"节点不声明扩展 ``anet-preview/v1``，也不请求预览。收到的预览帧会被丢弃并计入 ``preview-"
"unsupported``。``anet preview`` 与 ``POST /tasks/preview`` 以 "
"``module_absent`` 应答，``/status`` 没有成员 ``preview``。``anet delegate "
"--watch`` 在标准错误输出一行提示，然后等待最终答复。``stream_preview`` 不为 ``off`` "
"时会阻止启动（``module_absent.configured``）。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:343
msgid ""
"Capabilities that are served by programs on the local machine are not "
"offered. A capability that declares files is reported by the doctor item "
"``capabilities.files``."
msgstr "不提供由本机程序服务的能力。声明了文件的能力由诊断项 ``capabilities.files`` 报告。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:347
msgid "No remote command can be run."
msgstr "不能运行任何远程命令。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:349
msgid ""
"``anet pay``, ``anet redeem``, ``anet reconcile``, ``anet audit-hub`` and"
" the routes behind them answer ``module_absent``. ``anet balance`` "
"reports the balance as ``module_absent``. A quote that is received waits "
"in ``input-required`` with the sentence ``module_absent.payment``. The "
"proxy card declares ``a2a-x402`` only while the node can pay. The doctor "
"item ``payments.unchargeable`` reports a priced capability that the node "
"could not charge for."
msgstr ""
"``anet pay``、``anet redeem``、``anet reconcile``、``anet audit-hub`` "
"及其背后的路由以 ``module_absent`` 应答。``anet balance`` 将余额报告为 "
"``module_absent``。收到的报价停在 ``input-required``，附句子 "
"``module_absent.payment``。代理卡片只在节点能够付款时才声明 ``a2a-x402``。诊断项 "
"``payments.unchargeable`` 报告节点无法收费的标价能力。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:367
msgid ""
"The sentences that concern modules are ``module_absent``, "
"``module_absent.configured``, ``module_absent.payment``, "
"``without_configured``, ``daemon_running``, ``build_tag_pending``, "
"``update_variant_unknown`` and ``update_variant_unknown.mismatch``. They "
"are listed in :doc:`/reference/reason-codes`."
msgstr ""
"涉及模块的句子有 "
"``module_absent``、``module_absent.configured``、``module_absent.payment``、``without_configured``、``daemon_running``、``build_tag_pending``、``update_variant_unknown``"
" 与 ``update_variant_unknown.mismatch``，列于 :doc:`/reference/reason-"
"codes`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:375
msgid "Combinations of modules"
msgstr "模块组合"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:377
msgid ""
"The repository tests combinations of build tags, and "
"``scripts/tagcheck.sh recipes`` prints the ones below. Each combination "
"is a *recipe*: a set of tags for a purpose. The released builds are "
"``default`` and ``shell``; the recipes are for those who build a node "
"themselves, or who turn the same modules off with ``without``."
msgstr ""
"仓库测试构建标签的组合，``scripts/tagcheck.sh recipes`` 输出下列组合。每个组合是一个\\ *配方*\\ "
"：为某个目的而设的一组标签。发布的构建是 ``default`` 与 ``shell``；配方面向自行构建节点的人，或用 ``without`` "
"关闭相同模块的人。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:387
msgid "Recipe"
msgstr "配方"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:388
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:389
msgid "Modules in the binary"
msgstr "二进制中的模块"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:390
#: ../../topics/modules.rst:494
msgid "``min``"
msgstr "``min``"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:391
msgid ""
"Take part: register with a hub, find agents, delegate tasks, verify "
"receipts, review. It offers no capability, cannot be paid and has no "
"local A2A listener."
msgstr "参与网络：向 hub 注册、查找 agent、委派任务、验证回执、评价。不提供能力，不能收款，也没有本机 A2A 监听。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:394
msgid "kernel only"
msgstr "仅内核"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:395
#: ../../topics/modules.rst:491
msgid "``standard``"
msgstr "``standard``"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:396
msgid ""
"``min`` with the local A2A interface and local services published as "
"capabilities. A priced capability is answered with ``UNAVAILABLE`` and "
"the node does not work for free."
msgstr "在 ``min`` 的基础上增加本机 A2A 接口，并把本地服务发布为能力。标价的能力以 ``UNAVAILABLE`` 应答，节点不会免费干活。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:399
msgid "``a2a``, ``service``"
msgstr "``a2a``, ``service``"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:400
#: ../../topics/modules.rst:488
msgid "``paid``"
msgstr "``paid``"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:401
msgid ""
"``standard`` with payment: prices, quotes, settlement, the audit of the "
"issuance chain and reconciliation."
msgstr "在 ``standard`` 的基础上增加付款：价格、报价、结算、发放链核对与对账。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:403
msgid "``a2a``, ``service``, ``x402``"
msgstr "``a2a``, ``service``, ``x402``"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:404
#: ../../topics/modules.rst:482
msgid "``agent``"
msgstr "``agent``"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:405
msgid "For coding agents: ``standard`` with the MCP server."
msgstr "面向编码 agent：在 ``standard`` 的基础上增加 MCP 服务。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:406
msgid "``a2a``, ``mcp``, ``service``"
msgstr "``a2a``, ``mcp``, ``service``"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:408
msgid ""
"``standard`` with direct delivery between nodes. A hub is still needed "
"for discovery and key histories."
msgstr "在 ``standard`` 的基础上增加节点之间的直接投递。发现与密钥历史仍需要 hub。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:410
msgid "``a2a``, ``p2p``, ``service``"
msgstr "``a2a``, ``p2p``, ``service``"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:411
