msgstr "``full``"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:412
msgid "Every module except ``shell``."
msgstr "除 ``shell`` 以外的所有模块。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:413
msgid "all"
msgstr "全部"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:415
msgid ""
"The recipes ``min``, ``standard``, ``paid``, ``agent`` and ``p2p`` leave "
"out ``autoreply`` and ``preview``; both are in ``full`` only."
msgstr ""
"配方 ``min``、``standard``、``paid``、``agent`` 与 ``p2p`` 不含 ``autoreply`` 与 "
"``preview``，二者只在 ``full`` 中。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:418
msgid ""
"The ``console`` module has no tag. Every recipe therefore contains the "
"console; it is the only entry that does not use the bearer token, and it "
"can be turned off with ``without``."
msgstr "``console`` 模块没有标签，因此每个配方都包含控制台；它是唯一不使用持有者令牌的入口，可以用 ``without`` 关闭。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:422
msgid ""
"The modules in a build determine what the node can be asked to do. "
"Leaving out every optional module saves 19 per cent of the binary. The "
"module ``mcp`` is the largest part of that saving, because it links the "
"MCP library; ``autoreply`` and ``a2a`` follow. The sizes below are those "
"of a Linux amd64 build of the release candidate with ``-trimpath -ldflags"
" \"-s -w\"``."
msgstr ""
"构建中的模块决定节点可能被要求做什么。去掉所有可选模块可使二进制缩小 19%。其中 ``mcp`` 占最大部分，因为它链接了 MCP 库；其次是 "
"``autoreply`` 与 ``a2a``。下列大小为候选版本在 Linux amd64 上以 ``-trimpath -ldflags "
"\"-s -w\"`` 构建的结果。"

