#: ../../topics/modules.rst:501
msgid ""
"The recipes ``paid``, ``p2p`` and ``full`` contain modules that open "
"listeners or spend credit only after the operator configures them. The "
"module ``shell`` is the only module that turns a network request into a "
"command on the host. It is additive, it is not part of any recipe, and it"
" is not combined with ``full`` in the released builds."
msgstr ""
"配方 ``paid``、``p2p`` 与 ``full`` 所含的模块，只有在运营人员配置之后才会打开监听或花费额度。模块 ``shell`` "
"是唯一把网络请求变成宿主机命令的模块；它是加法模块，不属于任何配方，在发布的构建中也不与 ``full`` 组合。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:508
msgid "Updating"
msgstr "更新"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:510
msgid ""
"``anet update`` selects the build by the name of the variant that is "
"written into the binary. A node installed as the default build is updated"
" to the default build and a node installed with ``--shell`` to the "
"``shell`` build. A binary built locally has no variant, and ``anet "
"update`` does not replace it. The setting ``without`` is part of the "
"configuration and stays in force after an update."
msgstr ""
"``anet update`` 根据写入二进制文件的变体名称选择构建。以默认构建安装的节点更新为默认构建，用 ``--shell`` "
"安装的节点更新为 ``shell`` 构建。本地构建的二进制文件没有变体，``anet update`` 不会替换它。\\ ``without``"
" 设置属于配置，更新后继续有效。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:517
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:519
msgid ""
"A module that is turned off with ``without`` is not a security boundary "
"against other code that runs as the same user. Such code can edit "
"``config.json`` and replace the binary. The setting protects against "
"network peers and against callers that hold only the control token."
msgstr ""
"用 ``without`` 关闭的模块，对于以同一用户身份运行的其他代码而言并非安全边界。此类代码可以编辑 ``config.json`` "
"并替换二进制文件。该设置防范的是网络对端，以及仅持有控制令牌的调用方。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:523
msgid ""
"An additive module such as ``shell`` needs a different binary, and a "
"subtractive module needs only a different configuration. The installation"
" option of the module is chosen once, and the features are turned on by "
"their commands: ``anet autoreply set``, ``anet preview on`` and ``anet "
"payments set``."
msgstr ""
"附加式模块（如 ``shell``）需要不同的二进制文件，减法式模块只需要不同的配置。模块的安装选项只选择一次，功能由各自的命令开启：``anet"
" autoreply set``\\ 、\\ ``anet preview on`` 和 ``anet payments set``\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/modules.rst:527
msgid ""
"Do not edit ``without`` by hand while the node is running. The daemon "
"reads the list at start, and a change takes effect at the next start."
msgstr "节点运行期间不要手动编辑 ``without``\\ 。守护进程在启动时读取该列表，更改在下次启动时生效。"

